For Col A S Miles Harpers
Ferry Asp will forward by conveyance
period you will obey such orders
as Gen McC may give you . you
will endeavor to open communications with
him & with your forces to
his at the earliest possible moment
his Army is now near
the line of the Monocacy
signed Abortion copy sent to
Genl Wood Balto of Hen Smith


From Damascus Sept 12th 62
Hd Qrs For Steuben Two miles North of
Damascus Sept 12th 530 AM For Asia
& Abel a squadron of Cavalry
has just returned from New Market
& gives us the positive information
that the place was evacuated yesterday
the rear leaving at imagine the
force there consisted of four regts
Cavalry & six pieces of Arty
under Fitzhugh Lee the Regts were

